the cries of valor players everywhere  have finally been answered jet has  received a huge nerf the community has  been celebrating but is this nerf really  for the best or  did riot just kill jet  all right y'all it's a girl liz again  back at it again with another valerian  video valerian is to liz as tsm is to  danny so don't forget to hit that like  button that subscribe button and to ring  that notification bell let me start out  this video by saying for once let's be  nice to jet mains it's been a rough week  for them jet means you want some water  some snacks do you want i have an energy  drink are you okay now that the jet  mains are tucked away and resting  soundly the rest of us can bring out the  champagne because jet got nerfed baby  let's go  in all seriousness jet is getting a big  nerf on monday after patch 4.08 releases  instead of being able to instantly use  her tailwind or her dash a jet player  has to press the ability key once and  then press it again to use it within a  12 second time frame she doesn't use it  within 12 seconds it's gone like always  though you can still get it back with  two kills the reactions so far have been  pretty positive and some said it was  fine but maybe it didn't go far enough  the jet mains were understandably upset  at the nerf except for you know arguably  one of the best jets in the world durka  and some people made great jokes it's me  i made the great jokes i am the zoomer  of the office i hold a monopoly on the  memes i'm still not over heco retiring  so here is a clip of him reacting to the  nerf i like it you have to pick you have  like a little window when to dash or you  just insta double dash like you press e  twice and then you dash i think it's  good it just makes it so that like you  have to have some kind of you have to  put some kind of brain into when you  want to dash entry dashing still going  to be the same  but it's more  or less like the aggressive jet offing  you can't just insta dash away now so  it's a lot more it's a lot harder to  take an aggressive angle and be ready to  dash if you're not already in like that  dash now whether you're a ballerina die  hard or just a casual fan it's safe to  say that this is a pretty big change for  jet you see jet players had the luxury  of a get out of jail free card where  they could dash away at the first sight  of danger for a very long time her dash  also made her objectively the best asian  to op on until chamber came around so  why does this pretty big nerf exist well  according to riot a lot of different  reasons they said quote some of her  other impacts on the game have pushed  beyond valerian's core tactical cycle  and worrisome ways valrant's core  tactical cycle now if you're like me  your first thought might have been  what is this no like seriously just i  don't know what the hell this is lucky  for us they hyperlinked it with a lovely  photo of brim it is a circle with quote  intel plan and execute that is literally  the cycle it's your natural thought  process it's not that deep you get the  information you relay the information to  your team and you decide what to do that  information and you do it so where does  jets not fit into this well jet means  you might not know this but you tend  just to  go and do it a lot instead of hitting  all three points of valorman's tactical  cycle you get the intel and then you  execute there is no plan involved you  just get in and get out see riot spotted  a couple of main issues with her old  dash rya believes that jet players  didn't have to think as hard as others  or react to and rectify mistakes without  penalty they felt she had too much power  on the op and can get away from other  agents util too easily something they  keep harping on even towards the end of  the article is that they want jet to be  rewarded for making the right calls  jetstash having no prerequisites and  immediate use is her get out of jail  free card five people holding a site she  can get out walks into an op she can  zoom unlike other agents jett didn't  need as much info to execute her  and that caused an imbalance duelists  are expected to seek out those fights  yes but as a sentinel player or even a  controller  i cannot help you unless i know what you  are doing and when you are doing it  jet's motto literally could be no  thoughts just feed and that is a  hindrance to the rest of her team  whether jets know it or not but i know  what you're going to say liz what about  chamber what about yoru you're right  they have a very similar style of being  able to get out when danger is near but  baby what is the one thing you have to  do when you play those agents plan and  place your util you might be wrong  sometimes or your util might get  destroyed yoru and chamber have to  operate under more risk to get their  reward chamber cannot accidentally walk  into a missed op shot place both of his  tp's and then tp out in time before the  second op shot hits him think about it  this way right sentinel players like  myself have to set up on sites right you  put your util down and you hope for the  best sometimes you are wrong  but if you begin to notice enemy habits  and adapt you're rewarded for that game  sense riot wants their jets to use their  aggressive util and nature well not  carelessly so how can this all affect  pro play moving forward while a weaker  jet could open the door for other agents  we've already seen a shift to chamber as  the go-to opera and maybe this will help  accelerate that shift now if we could  predict everything about how the metas  would shift i would go buy a lottery  ticket but we can predict that this may  push jet out of the opera's favor  perhaps her role will return to what  many feel she was designed to do an  entry fragger that takes up space her  opponents may not be prepared for the  cold hard truth is if you are upset or  worried about this nerf you do not  understand the core part of this game  beyond the tactical cycle  it is a role-based team game we all have  our part to play and jet is a huge part  of that but just like everyone else on  the team in order to achieve our success  we need to work together that is  literally what riot designed for us to  do does it suck not to have a get out of  jail free card yes but welcome to  literally everyone else's world this  will absolutely take some getting used  to but i promise you that this is better  for the game's future as a whole i pinky  promise and i would never lie to you my  lovely valorant community let's just see  how this works out and jets i wish you  the best of luck when i peek you with my  op you're not going to need it  i want a complete overhaul of phoenix i  want him i have so many ideas for  phoenix you guys want to see me my my  like dream phoenix vision video  he could be so good and i feel like  right now he's a great beginner duelist  but like people and then he's there are  better duelists to use like jet but  our boy could do so much better

